The wall's and the e-paper panel's glyphs are drawn in this repository and are
nobody else's work — see apps/display/src/glyphs.ts, which says why nothing off
the shelf would do.

The bundled wallpapers are this project's own work too, generated by the
scripts under scripts/wallpapers/ and licensed with the application — see
apps/server/assets/wallpapers/LICENSES.md. The photographs and paintings
beside them are not, and are credited below.

